      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered the same issue today.\n\nAn EAC error suddenly occurred and returned me to the VRChat Home. After that, when I tried to join to the previous instance, the screen went black after loading finished.\n\nI confirmed that deleting the world cache and then preloading the world (for example, by entering another instance of the same world) before attempting to join the instance resolves the issue.\n\nThis is the second time I have encountered this issue, but the conditions under which it occurs are currently unknown.\n\nI have attached the logs.\n\n[Timeline]\n\n2026.02.04 08:31:21 Attempting to move instance\n\n2026.02.04 08:31:29 Instance move successful\n\n There are no issues during this period.\n\n2026.02.04 08:32:59 EAC Error\n\n Authentication with the VRChat Anti-Cheat system failed.\n\n2026.02.04 08:33:09 Returned to VRChat Home\n\n2026.02.04 08:33:24 Attempting to join to the previous instance\n\n2026.02.04 08:33:29 Black screen\n\n OnJoinRoomFailed(32752, \"You cannot enter this instance at this time, please try again later\")\n\n Resetting game flow because \"Failed to join room for unknown reasons\": [TryAlternateInstance, SkipLogin]",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-07-23T13:00:46.174Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please excuse my poor English.\n\nI also checked Cany in advance, but I couldn't find the same issue, so I apologize if this is a duplicate.\n\nWhen attempting to join an instance, if you are dropped due to an EAC error, when you try to enter that instance (the one you were trying to join immediately before) after restarting,\n\nthere is a high probability that you will not be able to enter the instance.\n\nThe specific process is as follows.\n\n==========\n\n1. An EAC error occurs.\n\n2. Restart VRC.\n\n3. Attempt to join the instance you were trying to enter previously.\n\n4.A You cannot enter the instance, and another instance in the same world starts up and you are transported there.\n\n4.B The loading is complete, but you cannot enter the instance and are transported to a location that is not the respawn point in the same world (presumably the world origin), where you cannot move and the UI cannot be opened.\n\n==========\n\nThis issue was resolved by clearing the cache and preloading the world.\n\nThe solution I implemented is as follows.\n\n==========\n\n1. Restart VRC after EAC error.\n\n2. Delete cache (restart VRC to delete).\n\n3. Set up the world of the problematic instance in a separate instance and load it first.\n\n4. Join the problematic instance.\n\n==========\n\nThis problem occurs with high probability when an EAC error occurs.\n\nThat is why I chose this title.\n\nEAC sometimes malfunctions.\n\nWhen that happens, I can't return to the instance for a while,\n\nwhich makes me feel sad.\n\nI know you are busy, but I would appreciate it if you could investigate this issue.\n\n--------------------\n\nThe following is the same content written in Japanese.\n\n(As I am a Japanese speaker, I hope this will be helpful as a reference if you do not understand the English.)\n\n--------------------\n\nインスタンスへJoinしようとした際に、EACによるエラーによって落とされた場合、再起動後にその（直前にJoinしようとした）インスタンスへ入ろうとした時に、\n\n高確率でインスタンスへ入れない問題が発生しています。\n\n具体的なプロセスは以下の通りです。\n\n==========\n\n1. EACエラーが発生する\n\n2. VRCを再起動する\n\n3. 直前に入ろうとしたインスタンスへJoinしようとする\n\n4.A インスタンスに入れず、同ワールドの別のインスタンスが立ち上がりそこに飛ばされる\n\n4.B ロードが終わるものの、インスタンスには入れず、同ワールドのリスポーン地点ではない場所（予想ではワールド原点）に飛ばされ、移動もできずUIも開けない状態に陥る\n\n==========\n\nこの問題はキャッシュを削除し、ワールドを事前にロードすることで解消できました。\n\n私が実行した解決方法は以下の通りです。\n\n==========\n\n1.EACエラー後にVRCを再起動\n\n2.キャッシュを削除（削除のためにVRCを再起動）\n\n3.問題のインスタンスのワールドを別インスタンスで立てて先にロード\n\n4.問題のインスタンスにJoin\n\n==========\n\nこの問題はEACエラーが起きたときに、高確率で発生します。\n\nそのため、このタイトルをつけさせていただきました。\n\nEACは時々誤作動を起こしてしまうことがあります。\n\nその時にしばらくインスタンスへ戻れなくなってしまい、悲しい思いをすることが多いです。\n\nなので忙しいと思いますが、できれば調査をお願いします。",
